From 20bc17ab3c8ed5f59c6345f8d17f9a817544869c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gregory Williams <gregory.williams@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 20 Aug 2025 16:53:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 057/190] misc: xilinx-ai-engine: Add call to allocate a dmabuf
 buffer

commit 92b479f5088cba633f14445782f201bbfea62be6 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Adds call to allocate a dmabuf buffer for use within kernel space. With
given size, the call will create a dmabuf, attach it to the partition,
then return the virtual address of the buffer and the file descriptor.
Also adds call to free the dmabuf.

Signed-off-by: Gregory Williams <gregory.williams@amd.com>
Acked-by: Govindarajulu Varadarajan <govindarajulu.varadarajan@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20250820235329.500334-5-gregory.williams@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
